; mh_net_udp.def -- mh_net_udp.dll's EXPORT LIST (tracker mp:T1).
;
; THE SAME LIST AS mh_net.def, AND THAT IS THE POINT. mh.dll binds ONE net module per run, chosen by
; `[net] transport` (mh/seams/module_bind.cpp), and it resolves the same 26 contract symbols plus the
; two module-level entries whichever file it opens. A transport that exported a different set would
; not be a second implementation of the contract, it would be a second contract.
;
; So the three reasons mh_net.def is a .def rather than __declspec(dllexport) apply here unchanged:
;
;   1. The list is the CONTRACT, and a contract wants to be one readable file.
;      tools/check_module_bind.py --net-surface asserts that THIS file and
;      mh_common/include/mh_net_module.h's MH_NET_MODULE_SYMBOLS table agree in both directions --
;      and since T1 it asserts the same of both .def files, so the two transports cannot drift apart
;      from each other either. A symbol added to one and forgotten in another is a red rather than a
;      null call at boot.
;   2. It exports the transport WITHOUT touching udp_transport.cpp's declarations.
;   3. No import library is produced for anyone to link by accident. A single mh_net_udp.lib on some
;      future link line would put this file in that module's IMPORT TABLE, and a missing file would
;      then fail PROCESS LOAD before one instruction of ours ran (measured at fork F4A: 0xC0000135,
;      zero log directories). Absent-tolerance is the whole shape of the module split.
;
; ORDER MATCHES MH_NET_MODULE_SYMBOLS, then the two module-level entries. Names are undecorated:
; everything here is `extern "C"` __cdecl.
;
; NOT HERE, for the same reasons as in mh_net.def: MH_Net_Init and MH_Net_Shutdown (deleted at fork
; F4B, zero call sites) and MH_Key_Random (the transport's own CSPRNG entry, no caller outside).
LIBRARY mh_net_udp
EXPORTS
    MH_Net_InitEx
    MH_Net_Send
    MH_Net_Recv
    MH_Net_PeerCount
    MH_Net_LocalPlayerId
    MH_Net_IdAssigned
    MH_Net_ActivePeerIds
    MH_Net_TakeDeadPeer
    MH_Net_IsStarted
    MH_Net_GetStats
    MH_Net_SetPeerHorizon
    MH_Net_QueueMatchBoundary
    MH_Net_SetSessionInfoHandler
    MH_Net_SendSessionInfo
    MH_Net_SetJoinHandler
    MH_Net_SendJoin
    MH_Net_SetStartHandler
    MH_Net_SendStart
    MH_Net_SetLeaveHandler
    MH_Net_SendLeave
    MH_Net_SetAnnounceHandler
    MH_Net_SendAnnounce
    MH_Net_SetHashHandler
    MH_Net_SendHash
    MH_Key_Load
    MH_Net_SnapshotSend
    MH_Net_SnapshotPoll
    MH_Net_SnapshotStatus
    MH_NetModule_Init
    MH_NetModule_Probe
